## Notes for the chat-mode author

(Delete this section before committing.)

Chat modes vs agents:
- Use **chat mode** for: ad-hoc personas, exploratory thinking sessions, voice/style overlays
- Use **agent** for: scoped work with tool restrictions, multi-turn task coordination, anything that should auto-route on `@-mention`

If you're tempted to add tools / scope / routing to a chat mode, you actually want an agent. Make it `.github/agents/<name>.md` instead.
